  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First prerelease. Plays Loom's three English releases, the DOS EGA, the FM Towns and the DOS VGA CD, from the start to the end, with their sound: the EGA on the PC speaker, PCjr/Tandy, Game Blaster, AdLib or, with your own ROMs, an emulated MT-32; the FM Towns' FM and PCM chips and CD audio; the VGA CD's voices and music. Saves in ScummVM's format, loading both ways. Headless runs write screenshots, sound and video.",
